==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Rathian (Enemy)|Rathian]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

